   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the education law, in relation to requiring licensure for instructors in religion, dancing, music, painting, drawing, sculpture, poetry, dramatic art, languages, reading comprehension, mathematics, recreation, yoga, martial arts and athletics",
